<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Card <%= card.id %> Results - Decision Cards Game</title>
    <style>
        @font-face {
            font-family: 'Nekst';
            src: url('/fonts/NekstRegularDesktop.otf') format('opentype');
            font-weight: 400;
        }

        @font-face {
            font-family: 'Nekst';
            src: url('/fonts/NekstLightDesktop.otf') format('opentype');
            font-weight: 300;
        }

        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        body {
            font-family: 'Nekst', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, sans-serif;
            background: #3C3C3B;
            min-height: 100vh;
            padding: 40px 20px;
        }

        .container {
            max-width: 800px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            background: white;
            border-radius: 12px;
            padding: 40px;
            box-shadow: 0 20px 60px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2);
        }

        .breadcrumb {
            color: #999;
            font-size: 0.95em;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        .breadcrumb a {
            color: #FF6F5C;
            text-decoration: none;
        }

        .breadcrumb a:hover {
            text-decoration: underline;
        }

        h1 {
            color: #3C3C3B;
            font-size: 2em;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            line-height: 1.4;
            font-weight: 400;
        }

        .subtitle {
            color: #999;
            font-size: 0.95em;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }

        .results-section {
            background: #f9f9f9;
            border-left: 4px solid #5FEF8B;
            padding: 20px;
            border-radius: 4px;
            margin-bottom: 25px;
            color: #666;
            line-height: 1.6;
            font-size: 1.05em;
        }

        .section-title {
            color: #3C3C3B;
            font-size: 1.3em;
            font-weight: 400;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 10px;
        }

        .section-icon {
            font-size: 1.4em;
        }

        .results-section strong {
            color: #3C3C3B;
        }

        .navigation {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
            gap: 15px;
            margin-top: 30px;
            padding-top: 30px;
            border-top: 1px solid #eee;
        }

        .nav-btn {
            padding: 12px;
            background: #f0f0f0;
            color: #FF6F5C;
            text-decoration: none;
            border-radius: 6px;
            text-align: center;
            font-weight: 400;
            font-family: 'Nekst', sans-serif;
            transition: background 0.2s;
        }

        .nav-btn:hover {
            background: #e0e0e0;
        }

        .home-link {
            grid-column: 1 / -1;
            background: #999;
            color: white;
        }

        .home-link:hover {
            background: #777;
        }

        .reflection-box {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #F0FFF0 0%, #F0F9FF 100%);
            border-left: 4px solid #5FEF8B;
            padding: 20px;
            border-radius: 4px;
            margin-top: 20px;
            font-style: italic;
            color: #555;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="breadcrumb">
            <a href="/">Home</a> / <a href="/stakeholder-cards">Stakeholder Cards</a> / <a href="/stakeholder-cards/<%= card.id %>">Card <%= card.id %></a> / Results
        </div>

        <h1><%= card.title %> — Results</h1>
        <p class="subtitle">Stakeholder Perspective & Outcomes</p>

        <div class="results-section">
            <div class="section-title">
                <span class="section-icon">👥</span>
                <span>Stakeholder Impact</span>
            </div>
            <p><strong>[INSERT STAKEHOLDER IMPACT ANALYSIS]</strong></p>
            <p>Describe how the decisions made affected this stakeholder. What were the implications for their interests, concerns, and objectives? How did they experience the outcome?</p>
        </div>

        <div class="results-section">
            <div class="section-title">
                <span class="section-icon">🔄</span>
                <span>Alignment & Conflict</span>
            </div>
            <p><strong>[INSERT ALIGNMENT ANALYSIS]</strong></p>
            <p>Where did stakeholder interests align with the decisions made? Where was there conflict or misalignment? What trade-offs emerged from serving different stakeholder needs?</p>
        </div>

        <div class="results-section">
            <div class="section-title">
                <span class="section-icon">💭</span>
                <span>Key Takeaway</span>
            </div>
            <p><strong>[INSERT KEY LESSON FOR STAKEHOLDER ENGAGEMENT]</strong></p>
            <p>What's the most important insight about stakeholder relationships and leadership that this scenario reveals? How should leaders think about managing competing stakeholder interests?</p>
        </div>

        <div class="results-section">
            <div class="section-title">
                <span class="section-icon">🎯</span>
                <span>Reflection</span>
            </div>
            <div class="reflection-box">
                <p><strong>[INSERT REFLECTION PROMPT]</strong></p>
                <p>How might you approach stakeholder engagement differently based on this scenario? What did this reveal about the complexity of managing multiple interests and perspectives?</p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="navigation">
            <% if (prevId) { %>
                <a href="/stakeholder-cards/<%= prevId %>/results" class="nav-btn">← Previous Card</a>
            <% } else { %>
                <div style="grid-column: 1;"></div>
            <% } %>
            <% if (nextId) { %>
                <a href="/stakeholder-cards/<%= nextId %>/results" class="nav-btn">Next Card →</a>
            <% } else { %>
                <div style="grid-column: 2;"></div>
            <% } %>
            <a href="/stakeholder-cards" class="nav-btn">Back to Stakeholder Cards</a>
            <a href="/staff-cards" class="nav-btn">Go to Staff Cards</a>
            <a href="/" class="nav-btn home-link">← Home</a>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
